@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = replace-with-local-token
@tenantId = replace-with-authorized-organization
@systemId = replace-with-assigned-system
@capabilityId = replace-with-published-capability
@baselineId = copy-from-preview
@sourceRevision = copy-from-preview
@reviewRevision = copy-from-preview

### Preview prerequisites and provenance; no writes and no inferred allocation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/capability-subscriptions/responsibilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### Confirm as effective assigned ISSM/ISSO (not membership or global claims)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/capability-subscriptions/{{capabilityId}}/responsibilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baselineId": "{{baselineId}}",
  "sourceRevision": "{{sourceRevision}}",
  "reviewRevision": "{{reviewRevision}}",
  "allocations": [{
    "controlId": "AU-6",
    "inheritanceType": "Shared",
    "provider": "Synthetic provider",
    "customerResponsibility": "Customer reviews alerts daily."
  }]
}

### Reconcile current baseline (also repeat to check idempotence)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/capability-subscriptions/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### Deliver durable pending review work; no model call or approved-content change
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/systems/{{systemId}}/capability-subscriptions/review-impacts/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### Repeat a confirmation with stale source/review revision: expect 409
### Repeat all write requests as Mission Owner or CSP-admin-only: expect denial
### Change systemId to a foreign/unassigned system: expect 404 with no disclosure
